---
InheritParentConfig: true
# Boost.Test's test case macros define structs with external linkage.
#
# bugprone-use-after-move stays on, although tests check moved-from objects
# on purpose, which needs NOLINTs. clang-tidy picks the checks from the
# configuration of the file it compiles, also for the headers it includes, so
# turning it off here would stop it checking templates that only tests
# instantiate.
Checks: -misc-use-internal-linkage
...
